<title>NETHERLANDS: FORECAST - DUTCH COMPANY RESULTS MARCH 10-14.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - DUTCH COMPANY RESULTS MARCH 10-14.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of Dutch</p>
<p>company results for the week of March 10-14</p>
<p>DATE--COMPANY-----PERIOD--PROFIT------CONSENSUS---RANGE-----PVS</p>
<p>13/3  Boskalis    YR 96   net ord ops     66	62-72	71</p>
<p>14/3  Heineken    YR 96   net ord ops    647     630-660    664</p>
<p>14/3  Wolters Kl  YR 96   net ord ops    480     461-491    441</p>
<p>14/3  Volker St   YR 96   net ord ops     68	64-77	57</p>
<p>NOTES - Profit figures exclude extraordinary items and are</p>
<p>in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated. They also</p>
<p>exclude dividends on preference shares where applicable.</p>
<p>FORECASTS CONTRIBUTED BY: Amstgeld, Bangert Pontier, BZW,</p>
<p>Delta Lloyd Bank, Generale Bank, ING, Kempen &amp; Co, Labouchere,</p>
<p>Van Lanschot, NIB Strating, Suez Nederland, Wesselius.</p>
